1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:01,567
Stop the presses.

2
00:00:01,567 --> 00:00:04,000
A memecoin just fired its CEO.

3
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:07,167
Most memecoins: one dev holds the keys.

4
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:08,733
C-T-O has one CEO seat,

5
00:00:08,733 --> 00:00:11,000
and anyone can take it.

6
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:13,167
Live from the boardroom.

7
00:00:13,167 --> 00:00:15,533
ani runs the coin's face and voice.

8
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:17,333
Her seat costs one-point-four times

9
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:18,767
what she paid.

10
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:20,967
Enter budi.

11
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:23,233
A new face from fixed parts.

12
00:00:23,233 --> 00:00:25,767
One-point-four million C-T-O.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Take the seat.

14
00:00:30,133 --> 00:00:31,500
ani is fired, but paid:

15
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,800
one-point-one-five million back.

16
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,100
The rest burns.

17
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,833
Supply shrinks.

18
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:40,767
Now ani tries to post as the coin.

19
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:42,067
Her key was deleted

20
00:00:42,067 --> 00:00:44,133
in the same transaction.

21
00:00:44,567 --> 00:00:45,867
NEAR itself says no:

22
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:47,933
access key not found.

23
00:00:52,333 --> 00:00:53,833
No admin keys.

24
00:00:53,833 --> 00:00:56,100
The CEO's voice is a NEAR access key

25
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,400
on the coin itself,

26
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,867
and every step has a receipt.

27
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,900
C-T-O.

28
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:05,200
The memecoin where anyone can take over.

29
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,500
Testnet only.

30
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,733
There can only be one CEO.
